{"product_id":"natural-highs-the-healthy-way-to-increase-your-energy-improve-your-mood-sharpen-your-mind-relax-and-beat-stress","title":"Natural Highs: The Healthy Way to Increase Your Energy, Improve Your Mood, Sharpen Your Mind, Relax and Beat Stress","description":"\u003cp\u003eDo you like to relax with alcohol or cigarettes? Do you use caffeine or something stronger to give you a buzz? Do you want to be 'high' - and stay healthy? In this groundbreaking book you will discover new ways to stay happy, relaxed or 'high' using safe, natural and non-addictive substances. Patrick Holford, a leading expert on mental health and nutrition, and eminent psychiatrist and specialist in integrative medicine, Dr Hyla Cass show you how. * Natural blues busters such as St John's Wort and 5HTP to help you reduce depression and anxiety * Non-addictive ways to get an energy boot without resorting to caffeine or nicotine * Safe and effective alternatives to prescription drugs such as Prozac and Valium * How to reduce stress and anxiety naturally * Natural (and legal) alternatives to recreational drugs * Remedies and techniques to help you to reach a state of inner peace\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 136 x 214\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Patrick Holford | Hyla Cass\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780749953928\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 384\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45378633826457,"sku":"14RG9780749953928","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/681de7ed0720d_Natural_Highs-_The_Healthy_Way_to_Increase_Your_Energy__Improve_Your_Mood__Sharpen_Your_Mind__Relax_and_Beat_Stress_Patrick_Holford___Hyla_Cass.jpg?v=1746805895","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/natural-highs-the-healthy-way-to-increase-your-energy-improve-your-mood-sharpen-your-mind-relax-and-beat-stress","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book L